# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 (a `let` names what its pattern binds; a dynamic named is that dynamic) and ch. 7 (a hold's write and its readers' change land in the tick of the firing): the label reads `$l`, which is `$n`.
test the_bound_dynamic_follows

